---
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";
---

<section id="why" class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-why-heading">
  <Wrapper variant="standard" class="about-section__grid">
    <p class="about-section__label">01 / Why this exists</p>
    <div class="about-section__body">
      <h2 id="about-why-heading">Some projects were waiting for the tools to catch up.</h2>
      <div class="about-prose">
        <p>
          My background crosses television, web publishing, photography, video, live entertainment,
          and digital production. The tools have changed repeatedly. The operating job has stayed
          recognizable: understand the brief, organize the people and material, build the workflow,
          troubleshoot what breaks, and get the work out.
        </p>
        <p>
          For years, some projects stayed unfinished because they required more money,
          infrastructure, specialized labor, or technical implementation than one person could
          reasonably assemble. Current AI tools reduce some of those bottlenecks. They do not decide
          what is worth making, what must remain true, what failed, or when the work is finished.
        </p>
        <p>
          HobFarm combines new tools with research, writing, photography, video, editing, web
          production, and production judgment. The goal is to finish the work, keep the decisions
          inspectable, and preserve the complete result somewhere more durable than a social feed.
        </p>
        <p>
          I schedule completed articles into the current 4:20 p.m. Pacific release slots, but I do
          not promise a daily cadence. HobFarm keeps the full article, project record, source
          context, and permanent URL. I use social, video, gallery, and marketplace platforms only
          when they give a finished piece a useful destination.
        </p>
      </div>
      <blockquote>
        New tools extend the production chain. They do not replace the judgment that gives the work
        a reason to exist.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </Wrapper>
</section>
